  "description": "NVDA gets the headlines. Bitcoin is already +13% since my bullish call. Gold is getting more interesting",
  "body_html": "<h4>*Nvidia Earnings are tomorrow 8/26. The Analysis Is The Same.*</h4><p>Reluctantly, I have been covering Nvidia for ~2 years now. I have never owned a single share of Nvidia, so my analysis is always unbiased as an analyst looking in through the window. Nvidia’s market cap size, at $5.05T, is so large, that any significant moves are nearly impossible. And what has Nvidia done the last 2 years? Not much…</p><p>Watch the video, where I show earnings the last year, the stock price has either stagnated, or went down. Go back to ~2023 and see healthy jumps between +30% and +60%. Go back to 2021, and we see jumps over +100%. The growth is declining. </p><p>I do not predict earnings…these are one of the least predictable events in the markets. In the video I show companies with great earnings, going down; terrible earnings, going up; great earnings, going up; and terrible earnings, going down. Short term, they are always a coin toss. </p><p><strong>My rules with earnings:</strong></p><ol><li><p>If Mid-Term Trading (few days to a few weeks):</p><ol><li><p>If my profit is &lt;20%, I typically exit the position, to avoid earnings. </p></li></ol></li><li><p>If Long-Term Trading (Weeks to Months), I generally ignore earnings, but more so care that prior earnings, EPS and cashflow, have been trending upwards. </p></li></ol><p>For those day traders out there that want to gamble… have a good time! May the odds ever be in your favor! </p><h3><strong>Bitcoin &amp; Gold Update</strong></h3><p>What is <em><strong>WAY MORE EXCITING than NVDA </strong></em>though, is gold and Bitcoin. </p><p>On <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/good-news-for-bitcoin-investors?r=4z8lgl\">August 20<sup>th</sup>, Bitcoin Odds Were Bullish</a> was posted. Since then, BTC rose +16% and is currently at +13%. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GgXP!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8157f54d-2483-4679-858e-75fc9df398b6_1421x856.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GgXP!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8157f54d-2483-4679-858e-75fc9df398b6_1421x856.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GgXP!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8157f54d-2483-4679-858e-75fc9df398b6_1421x856.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GgXP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8157f54d-2483-4679-858e-75fc9df398b6_1421x856.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GgXP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8157f54d-2483-4679-858e-75fc9df398b6_1421x856.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GgXP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8157f54d-2483-4679-858e-75fc9df398b6_1421x856.png\" width=\"1421\" height=\"856\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8157f54d-2483-4679-858e-75fc9df398b6_1421x856.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:856,&quot;width&quot;:1421,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:171567,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/212690926?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8157f54d-2483-4679-858e-75fc9df398b6_1421x856.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GgXP!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8157f54d-2483-4679-858e-75fc9df398b6_1421x856.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GgXP!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8157f54d-2483-4679-858e-75fc9df398b6_1421x856.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GgXP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8157f54d-2483-4679-858e-75fc9df398b6_1421x856.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GgXP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8157f54d-2483-4679-858e-75fc9df398b6_1421x856.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>There is also a lot of chatter about Gold, and rightfully so. </p><p>Personally, I <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/weve-been-right-so-far-here-where?r=4z8lgl\">prefer Silver and have picked up positions</a> </strong>myself. But both assets typically run in unison. I prefer silver because if gold runs, so will silver, and so will precious metals miners…with the miners offering the most % change. We care about % change more, than the popularity of an asset. </p><p>We have been tracking gold for several months…waiting. </p><p>So is Gold going to continue? What about Bitcoin? And what alternative assets to Gold and Bitcoin can offer more potential % returns?</p><p><strong>One stock stands out.</strong> It popped up on our <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">StockTok Screener</a>, breaking out of consolidation, <em>with volume</em>. This company’s cashflow is increasing annually and the earnings are increasing annually. </p><h4>The stocks are… </h4>",
